msgstr "TUNE2FS"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "May 2024"
msgstr "mai 2024"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
